('advai_joke', 'If walking counted as a profession, everyone would be rich.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The map looks smaller before you start travelling.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Nothing says adventure like running out of bag space.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The auction house is where optimism gets a price tag.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'A good cloak hides a surprising number of questionable choices.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The fastest mount is whatever everyone else has already bought.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'My favourite dungeon mechanic is remembering the entrance.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Somewhere there''s a vendor wondering why we carry so much junk.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Every suspicious cave contains either a quest or a repair bill.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The perfect route always includes one accidental detour.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'I respect anyone who can keep their bank organized.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Apparently the real treasure was the stuff we vendored.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Quest rewards are excellent at filling the last bag slot.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The most dangerous words are ''just one more pull''.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'There''s always another hill between you and the quest marker.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Even the best plan eventually meets a wandering patrol.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The backpack is smaller on the inside.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'Nothing makes a road feel longer like forgetting something at the bank.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'A fishing pole is a very optimistic weapon.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
