('advai_joke', 'Every mailbox looks close until you''re carrying everything.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_joke', 'The secret to saving gold is apparently not looking at auctions.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
